& [Delineation_A_EvidenceGrade] is one closed semantic type
  + answers what class of evidence an authorized issuer claims to bind
  + does not answer whether the candidate is presently unchanged
  + does not identify who produced the evidence
  + does not create acquisition lineage

& [Delineation_B_ObservedRelation] is separate
  + supplied pair Equal is a pure relation between two supplied canonical commitments
  + non-atomic repeated-inventory equality is an evidence grade over two actual temporally ordered complete acquisitions
  + snapshot proof is an evidence grade over one separately identified platform snapshot primitive
  + no relation creates its own provenance

& [Delineation_C_CandidateState] is unknown beyond observations
  + no evidence grade asserts uninterrupted quiescence unless its exact stronger contract says so
  + no repeated observation denies intermediate change-and-restore
  + no repeated observation denies later change
  + no supervisor-local evidence denies every external writer

& [Delineation_D_ProducerAuthority] is absent
